<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Some day my earthly house will fall,</l><l>I cannot tell how soon ’twill be,</l><l>But this I know—my All in all</l><l>Has now a place with Him for me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Or some day when my Lord will come,</l><l>And called to meet Him I’ll be blest,</l><l>He then will say to me, “Well done,”</l><l>And I shall enter into rest.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Some day, till then I’ll watch and wait,</l><l>My lamp all trimmed and burning bright,</l><l>That when my Savior I will greet,</l><l>My faith will then be changed to sight.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
